Kolibri-1 (architecture 'kolibri1') for llama.cpp's llama-server on macOS.
From kolibri1-llama.cpp.patch in https://huggingface.co/Hob-forge/Kolibri-1-GGUF at revision
b08405e141706457126fa75b9f2f9e0729b30d0a (sha256 e0d17c26a03784a8267cb16a7287e8b4e7d799979b584334770bf7eb620c66aa),
written for llama.cpp 836d571.  Kept: the C++ model, router and loader changes, gguf-py and the test; left out:
the Python converter (conversion/, convert_hf_to_gguf_update.py), which does not apply to Strata's pinned
llama.cpp and is not needed to run the GGUF.  setup.py applies it with `patch -p1` (build_engine_macos).

